<title>USA: Carolina First sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Carolina First sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNTON, N.C. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina First BancShares Inc Wednesday declared a two-for-one stock split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split will take the form of a a 100 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record August 8, 1997, payable August 22, 1997.</p>
</text>
